cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use EnerHabitat, please cite the reference article
  (preferred) and, if relevant, the software itself.
type: software
title: "EnerHabitat"
abstract: >-
  Thermal simulation of opaque constructive systems (walls and roofs)
  from EPW data — 1D multilayer and 2D non-homogeneous units (concrete
  hollow-block walls, joist-and-block roofs) with air cavities.
